# Frontend conventions

- Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Shadcn UI.
- Calculator lives at `/calc`; landing at `/`.
- Use Shadcn primitives; keep operator toolbar buttons accessible (`aria-label`).
- Call the backend via `src/lib/api.ts` and `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`.
- Prefer calm educational visuals; avoid purple-gradient / cream-serif AI clichés.
- RelAlg and SQL modes share the same execute → results → tree flow.
